{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel-labs/agent-browser/pulls/1691","id":4286966992,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQ3j5Ts7_hezQ","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser/pull/1691","diff_url":"https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser/pull/1691.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser/pull/1691.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel-labs/agent-browser/issues/1691","number":1691,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: repair Browser Use Cloud V4 provider","user":{"login":"MagMueller","id":67061560,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDYxNTYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67061560?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller","html_url":"https://github.com/MagMueller","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- create a Browser Use Cloud V4 browser and connect with its returned `cdpUrl`\n- stop that browser through agent-browser's existing provider lifecycle\n- support profile, managed proxy country or direct mode, and Cloud recording\n- update CLI help, README, provider docs, and the bundled command reference\n\n## Root cause\n\nThe provider treated `wss://connect.browser-use.com?apiKey=...` as a browser WebSocket. That endpoint returns discovery data, so the connection failed before agent-browser could run a command.\n\nThe fix is deliberately narrow:\n\n1. `POST /api/v4/browsers`\n2. read `id` and `cdpUrl`\n3. connect over CDP\n4. retain the provider session so close/relaunch/shutdown sends the V4 stop request\n\nIt adds no Browser Use-specific daemon, retry, transport, action, MCP, or analytics code.\n\n## Validation\n\n- live V4 smoke: create, connect, open `example.com`, read title and accessibility snapshot, close\n- focused Browser Use tests: 2 passed\n- full Rust suite, serial: 1,157 passed; 105 ignored; 0 failed\n- docs production build passed\n- `cargo fmt -- --check` passed\n- `cargo clippy` passed with one pre-existing warning in unchanged `native/cdp/chrome.rs:378`\n- `git diff --check` passed\n\nCloses #1514\nAddresses the Browser Use portion of #560\nImproves #1520\n","created_at":"2026-08-15T16:44:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T00:18:40Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ee39354d6b3f1c26b069f42ce44b2c42f9135ace","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel-labs/agent-browser/pulls/1691/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel-labs/agent-browser/pulls/1691/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel-labs/agent-browser/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel-labs/agent-browser/issues/1691/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel-labs/agent-browser/statuses/da4c99fa1c781b6bd6a440348c147287f0cdb603","head":{"label":"MagMueller:magnus/fix-browser-use-provider-v4","ref":"magnus/fix-browser-use-provider-v4","sha":"da4c99fa1c781b6bd6a440348c147287f0cdb603","user":{"login":"MagMueller","id":67061560,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDYxNTYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67061560?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MagMueller","html_url":"https://github.com/MagMueller","followers_